WEBVTT

00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:06.560
The Karasumori Site is a land
with special powers.

00:00:07.340 --> 00:00:09.900
The Kokuboro sent in assailants
in an attempt to take over the site,

00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:12.700
but Yoshimori and the others
were somehow able to fend them off.

00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:19.980
Soon after.
Kaguro appeared before Shishio.

00:00:19.980 --> 00:00:24.510
He gave Shishio a small egg and
invited him to join the Ayakashi.

00:00:27.760 --> 00:00:30.690
On his way to school,

00:00:30.690 --> 00:00:34.990
Yoshimori witnessed
Kaguro's exchange with Shishio.

00:00:36.100 --> 00:00:41.370
The dangerous forest invites me
It's showtime again tonight

00:00:41.370 --> 00:00:43.240
(Ayakashi NIGHT)

00:00:43.240 --> 00:00:48.440
Everyone's rampaging
with all their strength

00:00:48.440 --> 00:00:50.340
(Fighting late into the night)

00:00:50.850 --> 00:00:53.780
Drive away all hesitation

00:00:53.780 --> 00:00:58.190
Wanna take them on? Yeah

00:00:58.350 --> 00:01:01.720
I will protect you
(No matter what)

00:01:01.720 --> 00:01:05.060
I will protect you, that's all
(that's all I want)

00:01:05.060 --> 00:01:10.730
Goodbye to the days
when all I'd do was cry

00:01:13.030 --> 00:01:15.230
Sha la la la la...

00:01:16.570 --> 00:01:21.640
I hold words in my heart
that I'd like to say

00:01:21.640 --> 00:01:23.610
(Secret romance)

00:01:23.610 --> 00:01:28.820
Standing in front of me is someone
I don't want to lose

00:01:28.820 --> 00:01:30.580
(A strange distance)

00:01:31.050 --> 00:01:37.420
I can't stand watching
people get hurt anymore

00:01:37.490 --> 00:01:38.490
Yeah

00:01:38.490 --> 00:01:41.960
I wanna be your knight
(I wanna be strong)

00:01:41.960 --> 00:01:45.570
I wanna be your light
(More than I am now)

00:01:45.570 --> 00:01:50.900
Someday I'll share with you
my 100% smile

00:02:09.360 --> 00:02:10.350
Shishio.

00:02:23.970 --> 00:02:25.630
Shishio. What did he come here for?!

00:02:26.510 --> 00:02:27.770
Shut up!

00:02:38.390 --> 00:02:39.380
Shishio!

00:02:42.320 --> 00:02:44.260
Well then, please look after everything
while I'm gone.

00:02:44.760 --> 00:02:47.130
When will you return?

00:02:47.460 --> 00:02:53.660
I don't know, every Shikigami
I sent to Kokuboro was destroyed...

00:02:55.070 --> 00:02:57.000
I may encounter difficulties.

00:02:57.570 --> 00:02:59.270
And you're going there alone?

00:02:59.440 --> 00:03:02.030
I will contact you when I find out more.

00:03:02.780 --> 00:03:08.940
Since our enemies are in the Other World.
I have no choice but to do this myself.

00:03:09.320 --> 00:03:09.980
But-

00:03:10.150 --> 00:03:11.680
Don't worry.

00:03:15.020 --> 00:03:16.320
I-It looks just like you.

00:03:16.990 --> 00:03:20.860
I made it as elaborate as possible.
I'm sure it will be of use to you.

00:03:21.260 --> 00:03:22.660
That's Grandma for you.

00:03:23.030 --> 00:03:25.500
Tokine, you mustn't overdo things.

00:03:26.070 --> 00:03:27.260
I know but...

00:03:27.600 --> 00:03:29.330
I wonder if Gen-kun is all right?

00:03:29.900 --> 00:03:30.890
What is it?

00:03:30.970 --> 00:03:32.800
Nothing.

00:03:38.150 --> 00:03:40.880
Oh, no! I'm going to be late!
I'm off!

00:03:41.280 --> 00:03:42.410
See you.

00:03:45.750 --> 00:03:47.910
The head of the Yukimura family
is making her move?

00:03:48.020 --> 00:03:51.510
This is our chance.
We should invade them now.

00:03:51.730 --> 00:03:54.630
I knew that one of them would act.

00:03:55.000 --> 00:03:57.190
The fact that it was the Yukimura
was fortunate.

00:03:57.530 --> 00:04:01.160
She must be searching for
the way to the Kokuboro.

00:04:02.670 --> 00:04:07.660
You're ignoring me?
Hey, where's that nerdy octopus four-eyes?

00:04:08.540 --> 00:04:09.910
He's running around.

00:04:09.910 --> 00:04:11.710
Maintaining the castle is
becoming more difficult.

00:04:12.350 --> 00:04:15.180
The Princess's powers
seem to be weakening.

00:04:15.450 --> 00:04:17.680
We should invade right away.

00:04:17.920 --> 00:04:21.080
Should I calculate the entry point
and place some personnel?

00:04:21.920 --> 00:04:23.250
That won't be necessary.

00:04:24.230 --> 00:04:26.390
So is everything still
going according to plan?

00:04:26.930 --> 00:04:31.560
Don't underestimate me.
They are getting frantic as well.

00:04:35.100 --> 00:04:37.660
The Kokuboro is beginning to
move in full force.

00:04:37.970 --> 00:04:42.100
I know.
We are preparing ourselves, too.

00:04:42.980 --> 00:04:45.740
You must hurry.
I have a bad feeling about this.

00:04:46.450 --> 00:04:49.880
It's going to be all right.
Yoshimori is there.

00:04:55.890 --> 00:04:59.020
He's wearing a windbreaker
and not sleeping during class.

00:04:59.560 --> 00:05:04.460
Something must've happened.
Maybe a ghost appeared again...

00:05:07.800 --> 00:05:10.740
No. He's too kind, so he would...

00:05:14.510 --> 00:05:15.840
I want to know.

00:05:27.220 --> 00:05:28.480
Shut up!

00:05:32.630 --> 00:05:34.890
Is he really someone
you should get worked up over?

00:05:38.000 --> 00:05:40.760
Anyone can pretend to understand.

00:05:41.940 --> 00:05:44.170
Your big sister was the same.

00:05:47.410 --> 00:05:51.040
There's nobody who will ever like you.

00:05:51.650 --> 00:05:52.870
I'm the only one.

00:05:53.250 --> 00:05:56.510
The only one that understands you.

00:06:01.060 --> 00:06:02.040
Stand!

00:06:03.020 --> 00:06:03.680
Bow!

00:06:04.060 --> 00:06:06.530
I better ask what happened.

00:06:07.200 --> 00:06:08.960
He's already gone!

00:06:12.600 --> 00:06:13.590
Gen-kun?

00:06:14.140 --> 00:06:17.230
Yeah. He's not at school.

00:06:17.410 --> 00:06:19.040
Did you say something weird to him?

00:06:19.040 --> 00:06:20.130
I didn't!

00:06:20.910 --> 00:06:24.040
He really was talking to Kaguro.

00:06:25.110 --> 00:06:28.010
Underneath that human skin.
He was wrapped up in bandages!

00:06:28.620 --> 00:06:30.640
The Kokuboro are probably
making their move.

00:06:30.990 --> 00:06:31.970
Maybe...

00:06:32.350 --> 00:06:34.150
I wonder if Grandma will be all right.

00:06:34.490 --> 00:06:35.180
Huh?

00:06:35.360 --> 00:06:40.260
She's gone. She went to look for a path
to the Kokuboro by herself...

00:06:41.100 --> 00:06:43.560
Really? This is bad.

00:06:43.560 --> 00:06:46.300
If anything happens, I don't think
Grandpa Shige can take care of it alone.

00:06:46.300 --> 00:06:49.670
Times like this make me
more worried about Gen-kun.

00:06:50.370 --> 00:06:52.130
But we have to trust him.

00:06:52.210 --> 00:06:53.430
I know.

00:06:53.570 --> 00:06:54.770
Tokine!

00:06:55.040 --> 00:06:56.770
Let's go to the library.

00:06:57.180 --> 00:06:57.840
Sure.

00:06:58.210 --> 00:06:59.200
I'll see you later.

00:07:03.450 --> 00:07:05.940
That Shishio! Where did he go?

00:07:11.330 --> 00:07:12.880
Ow! Hey!

00:07:15.230 --> 00:07:18.390
Let's both try to be more careful, okay?

00:07:19.730 --> 00:07:21.430
Everyone runs away...

00:07:22.940 --> 00:07:25.600
That's right. I'm a monster.

00:07:26.540 --> 00:07:30.070
If you come over to our side,
you can be yourself.

00:07:32.310 --> 00:07:38.420
That kid saw you with him.
He thinks you betrayed him.

00:07:38.420 --> 00:07:39.410
Shut up!

00:07:39.620 --> 00:07:42.050
Then which side are you on?

00:07:42.360 --> 00:07:44.720
I... I...

00:07:56.440 --> 00:07:59.800
So what was that egg
you had me give the kid?

00:08:00.240 --> 00:08:01.670
I told you already...

00:08:02.240 --> 00:08:05.880
A loyal servant that takes
the appearance of its owner

00:08:05.880 --> 00:08:07.370
and whispers sweet words
in his ears.

00:08:07.880 --> 00:08:12.410
When the egg hatches,
the owner will be loyal, too.

00:08:12.950 --> 00:08:14.290
Loyal to me, that is.

00:08:15.920 --> 00:08:20.290
He hasn't thrown it away.
At this rate, it will hatch very soon.

00:08:21.030 --> 00:08:22.660
You did well in giving it to him.

00:08:23.900 --> 00:08:26.630
It's easy to shake up a kid.

00:08:27.030 --> 00:08:29.400
But I don't know if that kid
will come to our side.

00:08:29.740 --> 00:08:35.470
If you want a collaborator,
just jam your worm in his head.

00:08:36.140 --> 00:08:38.200
That requires a certain process.

00:08:38.750 --> 00:08:42.420
Yeah, unless you catch your
target off guard, you fail.

00:08:42.420 --> 00:08:44.180
Like with me.

00:08:46.290 --> 00:08:48.480
You only need to confuse them a little.

00:08:48.990 --> 00:08:53.390
The teamwork of those three is
the basic defense of Karasumori.

00:08:53.660 --> 00:08:55.250
You're being so careful.

00:08:55.360 --> 00:08:57.060
We are relocating the Princess.

00:08:57.530 --> 00:08:59.470
I must be careful.

00:08:59.870 --> 00:09:04.200
If you make a big commotion, those guys
called the Night Troops will get involved.

00:09:05.210 --> 00:09:07.270
I've already taken care of that.

00:09:11.010 --> 00:09:13.910
You want me to
take care of that mission?

00:09:14.450 --> 00:09:16.580
That's right. I leave it all to you.

00:09:17.180 --> 00:09:19.980
It's a very big and troublesome mission.

00:09:20.320 --> 00:09:26.230
There have already been many residents
possessed by the Ayakashi.

00:09:26.860 --> 00:09:30.020
You must hurry and quarantine
the entire village.

00:09:32.400 --> 00:09:35.030
You're not scared are you?

00:09:35.400 --> 00:09:40.470
No, but my main priority is
Karasumori right now.

00:09:41.040 --> 00:09:43.370
I cannot have another incident
take up my time.

00:09:44.350 --> 00:09:45.640
Don't you understand?

00:09:47.280 --> 00:09:49.650
I have not acknowledged you yet.

00:09:50.220 --> 00:09:53.350
If you can't take care of something
as insignificant as this...

00:09:53.350 --> 00:09:54.950
So you're testing me?

00:09:56.090 --> 00:09:59.290
A VIP from the Tohoku Branch
came begging to me for help.

00:09:59.530 --> 00:10:00.690
They'll be indebted to you.

00:10:01.330 --> 00:10:02.730
I don't know why,

00:10:02.760 --> 00:10:05.030
but the commander-in-chief
recommended you.

00:10:05.570 --> 00:10:06.760
The commander-in-chief?

00:10:09.440 --> 00:10:11.300
I will gladly accept this.

00:10:13.980 --> 00:10:16.940
The Tohoku region? It's far.

00:10:17.780 --> 00:10:20.750
I can't act in haste if residents
are being possessed.

00:10:21.220 --> 00:10:23.780
It'll be reckless if
I end it quickly.

00:10:26.350 --> 00:10:29.920
No. I can and I will!
If not, Karasumori will...

00:10:48.110 --> 00:10:50.980
Hi, Gen. It's me! Me!

00:10:51.410 --> 00:10:52.400
Atora?

00:10:53.350 --> 00:10:57.220
Did you eat something bad?
I've never heard you say my name.

00:10:58.090 --> 00:11:00.380
It's nothing. What do you want?

00:11:00.890 --> 00:11:02.320
We have a change in plans.

00:11:02.720 --> 00:11:04.890
There's a big job right now,

00:11:04.890 --> 00:11:07.420
and most of our personnel
have to be moved there.

00:11:07.860 --> 00:11:10.300
The ones who were going
to Karasumori will be delayed.

00:11:12.500 --> 00:11:15.840
Chief says that he'll try to finish
as soon as possible,

00:11:15.840 --> 00:11:17.130
but this job is a bit complicated.

00:11:17.710 --> 00:11:20.300
We might have to stay there for a while.

00:11:20.510 --> 00:11:22.640
You can't come out!

00:11:23.840 --> 00:11:25.640
Oh, I'm sorry. It's nothing.

00:11:26.450 --> 00:11:30.250
Anyway, Chief wants to take the lead
in the defense of Karasumori.

00:11:30.690 --> 00:11:32.080
So can you wait a little longer?

00:11:32.520 --> 00:11:33.510
Chief. Too?

00:11:33.650 --> 00:11:34.640
Of course.

00:11:34.890 --> 00:11:39.420
And I intend on staying with you
when I'm stationed there.

00:11:41.500 --> 00:11:42.480
Gen...

00:11:43.030 --> 00:11:45.660
Chief... where are you?

00:11:48.900 --> 00:11:50.270
I was looking for you.

00:11:50.970 --> 00:11:52.730
What are you going to do
about my uniform?

00:11:55.610 --> 00:11:58.340
I wish I had powers like yours.

00:12:01.180 --> 00:12:03.650
What's your problem?!
I don't get you!

00:12:09.390 --> 00:12:10.050
Byaku.

00:12:11.060 --> 00:12:12.290
The preparations are complete.

00:12:17.300 --> 00:12:18.370
Aihi.

00:12:18.370 --> 00:12:19.490
Call me "Aihi-san."

00:12:20.130 --> 00:12:22.160
Are you staying behind again?

00:12:22.600 --> 00:12:24.300
I'm not part of the Task Force.

00:12:26.940 --> 00:12:28.070
Wait a minute.

00:12:30.910 --> 00:12:32.640
Do you want me to take you out of here?

00:12:34.010 --> 00:12:35.380
Outside the castle?

00:12:39.320 --> 00:12:40.750
You're so cold.

00:12:45.290 --> 00:12:46.280
Let's go.

00:12:47.930 --> 00:12:49.490
It's your turn now.

00:12:55.700 --> 00:12:57.760
Did something happen, Yoshimori?

00:12:58.940 --> 00:13:00.300
How is Shishio-kun doing?

00:13:00.910 --> 00:13:04.210
I... I haven't talked to him recently.

00:13:06.980 --> 00:13:08.410
Look at this plate.

00:13:09.320 --> 00:13:13.510
It has three legs, right?
It's not stable when there are only two.

00:13:13.990 --> 00:13:15.920
You can't let one go missing.

00:13:16.290 --> 00:13:18.950
I think you three are like that.

00:13:23.300 --> 00:13:25.560
I wonder where Grandma is.

00:13:25.770 --> 00:13:26.760
Who knows?

00:13:26.930 --> 00:13:31.560
Has Grandma ever been
away from home for a long time?

00:13:31.870 --> 00:13:33.240
She went on that day trip

00:13:33.240 --> 00:13:35.040
with the Senior Citizens' Association
the other day.

00:13:35.540 --> 00:13:39.150
During my school trip,
she took over my duties for me,

00:13:39.150 --> 00:13:41.210
but for Grandma to leave home
for so long...

00:13:41.350 --> 00:13:43.010
Now that you mention it, you're right.

00:13:44.150 --> 00:13:46.650
I feel uneasy that Grandma isn't here,

00:13:46.650 --> 00:13:49.850
but it should be okay since
Yoshimori and Gen-kun are with me.

00:13:50.160 --> 00:13:53.460
Grandma entrusted this to me
so I better do it right.

00:13:54.030 --> 00:13:56.090
You haven't
washed the soap off yet.

00:13:56.500 --> 00:13:57.490
I'm sorry.

00:14:03.970 --> 00:14:05.370
I don't like this one bit!

00:14:08.480 --> 00:14:09.640
Here's your lunchbox.

00:14:10.850 --> 00:14:11.830
Take care.

00:14:11.950 --> 00:14:15.380
Your grandfather says that
the winds are uneasy tonight.

00:14:15.880 --> 00:14:18.280
The winds...
All right.

00:14:23.560 --> 00:14:24.550
I'm off.

00:14:27.700 --> 00:14:31.460
Breaking a sandal strap has been
an ominous sign since ancient times.

00:14:35.170 --> 00:14:36.470
The time has come!

00:14:44.810 --> 00:14:45.870
Oh, Byaku-san.

00:14:46.650 --> 00:14:47.640
Are the preparations complete?

00:14:47.780 --> 00:14:48.980
Fully.

00:14:55.920 --> 00:14:56.580
Princess.

00:14:58.630 --> 00:14:59.820
Byaku!

00:15:00.790 --> 00:15:06.460
Are we really going to Karasumori?
Are we going to obtain Karasumori?!

00:15:06.600 --> 00:15:07.260
Yes.

00:15:08.300 --> 00:15:11.270
But please stay still here.

00:15:11.740 --> 00:15:14.370
You don't need to tell me that.
I can't move that much, anyway.

00:15:15.440 --> 00:15:19.880
It's been hundreds of years
since I left the castle. I can't wait.

00:15:21.350 --> 00:15:23.680
It seems like just
the other day you came

00:15:23.720 --> 00:15:26.690
to the Black Pampas Grass
to fight me, Byaku.

00:15:33.530 --> 00:15:35.360
That brings back memories.

00:15:38.000 --> 00:15:39.970
Will it go that well?

00:15:40.770 --> 00:15:45.900
That depends on your Task Force.
The groundwork has been laid.

00:15:46.010 --> 00:15:48.600
Byaku. Let's go now!

00:15:53.080 --> 00:15:54.070
Everyone!

00:15:54.250 --> 00:15:58.810
Tonight is the best opportunity for us
to relocate our Princess to Karasumori.

00:15:59.820 --> 00:16:03.650
All the winds blow in our favor!
Do not lose this opportunity!

00:16:05.660 --> 00:16:08.180
Let us go to battle!

00:16:37.220 --> 00:16:39.450
I can't wait to fight!

00:16:39.930 --> 00:16:43.420
I always hated moving
in large groups like this.

00:16:45.970 --> 00:16:50.840
Byaku! Byaku! Look.
The castle looks so small.

00:17:08.990 --> 00:17:12.430
What? You want me to
look for that kid again?

00:17:12.890 --> 00:17:14.860
Well, it seems like he's already here.

00:17:15.260 --> 00:17:17.960
It's only because it seems
like something's on his mind.

00:17:18.530 --> 00:17:21.840
You're so chummy with him now.

00:17:21.840 --> 00:17:24.460
It's not that! I just don't like it.

00:17:25.010 --> 00:17:28.070
Yoshimori. I have a bad feeling about this.

00:17:28.740 --> 00:17:32.970
Grandpa Shige said the same thing,
but we have to find Shishio first.

00:17:34.050 --> 00:17:37.180
I need to talk to him. Man to man.

00:17:48.800 --> 00:17:49.460
Chief?

00:17:51.030 --> 00:17:52.020
Can you talk right now?

00:17:52.400 --> 00:17:53.060
Yes.

00:17:53.530 --> 00:17:54.760
How are you doing?

00:17:55.770 --> 00:17:56.860
I'm doing okay.

00:17:57.070 --> 00:17:58.270
Just okay?

00:17:59.370 --> 00:18:00.360
What about you, Chief?

00:18:00.540 --> 00:18:07.040
Me? I'm okay too, I guess.
I'm sure you heard the news.

00:18:07.680 --> 00:18:09.510
About the big job?

00:18:09.950 --> 00:18:16.360
Yeah. There's nothing but mountains here.
It's a miracle I can even use my cell.

00:18:17.420 --> 00:18:20.390
Can you protect Karasumori
a little longer until I arrive?

00:18:21.260 --> 00:18:23.460
We've got some stuff
going on here, too...

00:18:27.330 --> 00:18:27.990
Yes.

00:18:28.270 --> 00:18:29.740
I'm counting on you.

00:18:31.740 --> 00:18:32.730
I'll see you later.

00:18:36.510 --> 00:18:37.640
Keep it up!

00:18:44.220 --> 00:18:46.210
Chief... I...

00:18:47.350 --> 00:18:51.480
The Chief is probably relieved
to be rid of you.

00:18:52.130 --> 00:18:55.060
Even among the Night Troops,
you're an outcast.

00:18:55.430 --> 00:18:57.900
The Chief probably
dispatched you to Karasumori

00:18:57.900 --> 00:19:00.460
because he found you
unmanageable.

00:19:00.700 --> 00:19:01.690
Stop!

00:19:01.940 --> 00:19:03.530
Hey, Shishio!

00:19:04.910 --> 00:19:07.370
I finally caught you.
Hey!

00:19:07.510 --> 00:19:13.380
Running away without listening to me?!
Hear no evil. Run no evil?! Get back here!

00:19:13.650 --> 00:19:17.280
I said wait! Hey! You think you're
so great because you can run fast?!

00:19:17.820 --> 00:19:19.550
What is he doing?

00:19:19.650 --> 00:19:23.450
Yoshi could never beat Gengen in a race.

00:19:24.990 --> 00:19:26.250
You're so dumb.

00:19:27.190 --> 00:19:29.060
Then how about this?!
Ketsu!

00:19:38.810 --> 00:19:42.540
Shishio!

00:19:43.610 --> 00:19:47.210
Pay for my uniform!
I mean, can you hear me?!

00:19:47.380 --> 00:19:52.980
I know you can! Just listen, you jerk!
Don't tell me to shut up!

00:19:53.050 --> 00:19:58.510
You're not talking, so I am.
Stop thinking all by yourself, idiot!

00:19:59.060 --> 00:20:03.290
If something's bothering you, tell me!
Wait. Never mind don't then!

00:20:03.360 --> 00:20:04.420
It'll be a drag!

00:20:05.000 --> 00:20:07.660
I don't know what's
bothering you so much...

00:20:08.470 --> 00:20:13.740
but... I think...
you shouldn't worry about it!

00:20:15.710 --> 00:20:19.310
At the very least, it won't bother me.
But I'm not sure. I think.

00:20:19.310 --> 00:20:20.300
That's it!

00:20:21.050 --> 00:20:24.750
Everyone heard the fool on the Kekkai.

00:20:25.350 --> 00:20:29.980
He can say things he doesn't mean.
He'll say he's your friend.

00:20:30.790 --> 00:20:32.820
But is that true?

00:20:33.130 --> 00:20:35.530
If they saw you completely transformed...

00:20:36.160 --> 00:20:39.190
...they would likely hate you.

00:20:40.130 --> 00:20:44.040
Come to our side.
Where monsters can live like monsters.

00:20:44.740 --> 00:20:49.940
You don't have to strain yourself.
Come to the Kokuboro.

00:21:02.120 --> 00:21:03.110
They're coming.

00:21:03.320 --> 00:21:05.460
Yeah. Outrageous ones at that.

00:21:05.460 --> 00:21:06.760
Wh-What is?

00:21:13.630 --> 00:21:14.290
Shion.

00:21:14.840 --> 00:21:17.400
Karasumori is drawing close.
Do it according to plan.

00:21:17.740 --> 00:21:19.260
Shut up. I already know that.

00:21:19.540 --> 00:21:23.000
Don't worry. You just want me to
keep them busy until morning, right?

00:21:23.180 --> 00:21:25.170
My underlings will do the job right.

00:21:25.650 --> 00:21:31.020
Shouldn't you keep an eye on Gagin,
to keep him from frolicking too much?

00:22:01.450 --> 00:22:03.380
Wh-What's going on?

00:22:20.570 --> 00:22:23.540
Your friends... have come!

00:22:48.560 --> 00:22:54.090
10 minute break,
I wanna do so much

00:22:55.970 --> 00:23:02.000
Class is over, but someone
in the front asks a question

00:23:02.380 --> 00:23:04.540
"What nerve"

00:23:04.950 --> 00:23:07.910
I'm at ease as long as
I have a mirror

00:23:07.950 --> 00:23:11.650
"Make up's on right,
my eyes look all right"

00:23:11.690 --> 00:23:18.020
See, if you look behind you,
there's a girl who curled her hair

00:23:18.360 --> 00:23:23.060
I hate studying,
I like P.E. Okay

00:23:23.100 --> 00:23:25.000
Basketball, volleyball,
and tennis, what?

00:23:25.030 --> 00:23:30.260
You're not gonna make me
run long distance today, teacher!

00:23:30.300 --> 00:23:33.800
My face will get oily,
and I hate being sore

00:23:33.840 --> 00:23:37.900
I'm that kind of
a beautiful high school girl

00:23:52.390 --> 00:24:02.730
10 minute break, I'll get busy
drawing a map of the future
